  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Development: Maldives Agribusiness Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme&apos;s goal is to sustainably increase the incomes, food security and nutrition status of small farmer households. Its development objective is the strengthened enabling environment for sustainable and climate-resilient agriculture. This objective will be achieved through reformed policies, strengthened institutions and services, enhanced agricultural technologies and better access to financing and markets for small farmer households.</narrative>
  </description>
